{"id":"n67737-1-7","stage":4,"title":"연일 · 连日","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67737-1-7-1","ko":"이 식당은 어때요?","zh":"这家餐厅怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당은","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3","entryId":"36693","definition":"制做并出售食物的商店。","pronunciation":["식땅"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/fc2e9cc396f10efc92ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67737-1-7-2","ko":"연일로 손님이 가득 찰 정도로 음식 맛이 좋대요.","zh":"据说因为味道太好，连日来客人都多得坐不下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"연일로","meaning":"连日","explanation":"연일：连日；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"연일","audio":"/audio/7c21c85622ab1efde108.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67737","senseId":"1","lemma":"연일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손님이","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가득","meaning":"挤满，装满，充满","explanation":"가득：挤满，装满，充满","readings":[{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62661","senseId":"2","lemma":"가득","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찰","meaning":"充满，饱含","explanation":"차다：充满，饱含；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"차다","audio":"/audio/d8eb940a7794fc46db6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37227","senseId":"1","lemma":"차다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도로","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음식","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋대요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7c21c85622ab1efd","term":"연일","zh":"连日","audio":"/audio/7c21c85622ab1efde108.mp3","entryId":"67737","definition":"持续多天。","pronunciation":["여닐"]},{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"260476e01310cd16","term":"가득","zh":"挤满，装满，充满","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3","entryId":"62661","defini